zi\u0165 pohyby, ktor\u00e9 tomu rame\u0148u pad\u00ed.", "tokens": [51179, 9118, 3307, 1790, 7891, 338, 1667, 281, 11, 25178, 41903, 79, 7891, 78, 705, 9159, 36414, 281, 1289, 272, 2303, 5232, 77, 378, 625, 78, 1111, 1912, 3992, 27101, 714, 3495, 2322, 11, 350, 21151, 526, 2916, 84, 367, 529, 129, 230, 84, 6887, 870, 13, 51434], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.23531007980551955, "compression_ratio": 1.6435045317220545, "no_speech_prob": 0.9729312062263489}, {"id": 28, "seek": 10400, "start": 104.0, "end": 109.4, "text": " Tak som pri\u0161el na to, ktor\u00e9 pohyby mus\u00edm obmedzi\u0165 a vyskala\u013e som si ponohodnoty treningov\u00fd pl\u00e1n, ktor\u00fd cvi\u010di\u0165 m\u00f4\u017eem.", "tokens": [50364, 9118, 3307, 1790, 7891, 338, 1667, 281, 11, 350, 21151, 526, 714, 3495, 2322, 1038, 14569, 1111, 1912, 3992, 27101, 257, 371, 749, 74, 5159, 46634, 3307, 1511, 9224, 1445, 378, 2247, 88, 2192, 773, 5179, 11822, 499, 7200, 11, 350, 21151, 11822, 269, 4917, 10236, 72, 27101, 275, 2851, 9159, 443, 13, 50634], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2536212012881324, "compression_ratio": 1.4750733137829912, "no_speech_prob": 0.7842419743537903}, {"id": 29, "seek": 10400, "start": 109.4, "end": 114.8, "text": " Toto bolo asi 3 alebo 4 m\u0148ace z 5, od tedy cvi\u010d\u00edm d\u00e1 sa poveda\u0165 bez obmedzen\u00ed, aplikujem jednoduch\u00e9,", "tokens": [50634, 1407, 1353, 272, 7902, 28644, 805, 6775, 1763, 1017, 275, 129, 230, 64, 384, 710, 1025, 11, 3611, 256, 6038, 269, 4917, 10236, 14569, 14401, 601, 714, 45716, 27101, 10782, 1111, 1912, 2904, 870, 11, 25522, 1035, 4579, 443, 5232, 77, 378, 625, 526, 11, 50904], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2536212012881324, "compression_ratio": 1.4750733137829912, "no_speech_prob": 0.7842419743537903}, {"id": 30, "seek": 10400, "start": 114.8, "end": 121.4, "text": " no d\u00f4le\u017eit\u00e9 pr\u00edncipy pre\u010do na efekt\u00edne\u010dne naberanie svalou, ktor\u00e9 pokia\u013e ma sleduje\u0161 tak vie\u017e, \u017ee st\u00e1le opakujem dooko\u013ea.", "tokens": [50904, 572, 274, 22313, 9159, 5066, 582, 10973, 537, 8200, 659, 10236, 78, 1667, 31482, 8192, 870, 716, 10236, 716, 297, 23298, 7155, 262, 3337, 263, 11, 350, 21151, 526, 13010, 654, 46634, 463, 46242, 13008, 7891, 991, 4941, 9159, 11, 25178, 342, 842, 306, 999, 514, 4579, 443, 360, 13704, 46634, 64, 13, 51234], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2536212012881324, "compression_ratio": 1.4750733137829912, "no_speech_prob": 0.7842419743537903}, {"id": 31, "seek": 10400, "start": 121.4, "end": 129.8, "text": " Za toto obdobie som sa prepr\u00e1coval z 92, bo 93 kg dne\u0161n\u00edch 100 kg, \u010do sa d\u00e1 poveda\u0165, \u017ee som op\u00e4\u0165 v mojej \u017eivotnej formi.", "tokens": [51234, 31440, 281, 1353, 1111, 67, 996, 414, 3307, 601, 2666, 30218, 1291, 3337, 710, 28225, 11, 748, 28876, 15696, 274, 716, 7891, 28988, 339, 2319, 15696, 11, 22392, 78, 601, 14401, 714, 45716, 27101, 11, 25178, 3307, 999, 737, 27101, 371, 36383, 73, 17305, 13142, 11794, 1254, 72, 13, 51654], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2536212012881324, "compression_ratio": 1.4750733137829912, "no_speech_prob": 0.7842419743537903}, {"id": 32, "seek": 12980, "start": 129.8, "end": 137.8, "text": " Chvala bohu, \u017ee som po\u010das tohto obdobia z rame\u0148u, m\u00f4\u017ede mal \u017eiadne probl\u00e9mino pon\u00e1\u010dne z tohto videa je, \u017ee zranienia netreba poce\u0148ova\u0165 niecvi\u010dce z neprijemn\u00fa boles\u0165.", "tokens": [50364, 761, 3337, 64, 748, 12086, 11, 25178, 3307, 714, 10236, 296, 281, 357, 78, 1111, 67, 996, 654, 710, 367, 529, 129, 230, 84, 11, 275, 2851, 9159, 1479, 2806, 17305, 38069, 716, 15201, 4011, 2982, 9224, 842, 10236, 716, 710, 281, 357, 78, 838, 64, 1506, 11, 25178, 710, 4257, 18811, 408, 3599, 4231, 714, 384, 129, 230, 27924, 27101, 2838, 66, 4917, 10236, 384, 710, 24901, 470, 30833, 77, 2481, 272, 7456, 27101, 13, 50764], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.29041355287013